# R2 on the GPU window (W4-WIN-CLOSE C2): the native window's own state while a change waits. The chunk
# builders are held so the edit stays "not drawn yet" for a fixed time; tools/test/window_state_case.py
# minimises the window, restores it and covers it with a topmost window meanwhile, and records what
# the backend does. The change must become Visible only after the release and a presented frame.
look 1140 516
key b
select 1307
rotate 0
wait frames 90
hold chunks
click 1156 516
wait outcome
wait blocked
checkpoint pending_start
wait ms 12000
checkpoint pending_end
expect visibility ChunksStale
release chunks
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint window_state_visible
quit
